        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPH-275, Retro Cabinet Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deco Ring Pull will add retro style to any small door or drawer. Install on kitchen cabinets, on accordion closet doors, or even on an armoire. It is available in 5 finishes, but we think the polished brass really brings out the retro feel. No matter what finish you choose, this cabinet ring pull will look great. It is easy to install and comes with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RPH275 Hex Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Widest Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
